        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Uranium natural, at underground mine
PSI data (BFE project 407, Christian Bauer, April 2012).;
UUID: e68046ab-62f7-308a-a3ae-c46d1520a046
The module includes: diesel used in generators for all mining uses; transport of the diesel fuel; radioactive and non-radioactive emissions to air and water; water use (mining water).
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average conditions in early 1980s.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e68046ab-62f7-308a-a3ae-c46d1520a046.xml</text>
